              <li><a href="/news/2026/10/omarchy-launches-bug-bounty-program-on-hackerone/" class="hover:text-brand hover:underline">.../omarchy-launches-bug-bounty.../</a></li>
              <li class="pt-2 text-[10px] text-text-secondary/70 italic">+ 24 artikel lainnya lengkap</li>
